# The v2 module is kept LF-only. gofmt, the postmangen golden fixtures and CI
# all compare bytes; a CRLF checkout makes every one of them disagree with what
# the repository actually holds. (The root module predates this and is left as
# it is, to avoid a renormalisation diff across its whole history.)
v2/** text=auto eol=lf
tag text eol=lf
.github/** text eol=lf
scripts/** text eol=lf
LICENSE text eol=lf
